{"id":"0beba8c2f97bc27f","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-sr-measure.md","title":"从归约尾部计数的Sekar–Ramakrishnan测度","display":"df-sr-measure — 从归约尾部计数的Sekar–Ramakrishnan测度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-sr-measure","aliases":["56-df-sr-measure"],"display":"df-sr-measure — 从归约尾部计数的Sekar–Ramakrishnan测度","depends_on":["[[56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction]]"],"source_section":"§8.5 Definition 8.5.17","source_printed_pages":"369","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-local-interface","source_proof_status":"read-source-proof-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-sr-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-sr-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sr-measure — 从归约尾部计数的Sekar–Ramakrishnan测度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38a37d8a0a52c221\" href=\"?note=38a37d8a0a52c221\" title=\"56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction\">56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.5 Definition 8.5.17"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"369"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-local-interface"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-source-proof-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)\\in\\mathcal P_R\">\\(\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)\\in\\mathcal P_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38a37d8a0a52c221\" href=\"?note=38a37d8a0a52c221\" title=\"56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction\">56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=L(\\Pi)\">\\(n=L(\\Pi)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathcal M\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathcal M\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 由下式引入；下式引入元组论域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span>、严格序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\triangleleft_{SR}\">\\(\\triangleleft_{SR}\\)</span> 及非严格序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd_{SR}\">\\(\\unlhd_{SR}\\)</span>。元组分量下标从0开始。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\{a\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}:a_0=n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\{a\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}:a_0=n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{SR}(\\Pi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}(0)&amp;n=0,\\\\(n,|U_{n-1}|,\\ldots,|U_0|)&amp;n&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mu_{SR}(\\Pi)\\in\\mathcal M.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_{SR}(\\Pi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}(0)&amp;n=0,\\\\(n,|U_{n-1}|,\\ldots,|U_0|)&amp;n&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mu_{SR}(\\Pi)\\in\\mathcal M.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\triangleleft_{SR}b\\iff a_0&lt;b_0\\lor\\bigl(a_0=b_0\\land\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(1\\le k\\le\\min(a_0,b_0)\\land a_k&lt;b_k\\land\\forall j&lt;k\\;(a_j=b_j))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\triangleleft_{SR}b\\iff a_0&lt;b_0\\lor\\bigl(a_0=b_0\\land\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(1\\le k\\le\\min(a_0,b_0)\\land a_k&lt;b_k\\land\\forall j&lt;k\\;(a_j=b_j))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\unlhd_{SR}b\\iff a=b\\lor a\\triangleleft_{SR}b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\unlhd_{SR}b\\iff a=b\\lor a\\triangleleft_{SR}b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{SR}(\\mathbf1^P_s)=(0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_{SR}(\\mathbf1^P_s)=(0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一分量是平行步数，其后才按尾到头给红项数，绝非总红项数或仅reverse tuple的字典序。不同长度先比较步数，补齐了原书在不同元数元组间使用同一字典序记号的隐含惯例。空平行步仍贡献长度与一个零分量；删除这种步严格降测度。标准化可以复制较早步骤，所以普通路径长度并非其统一递减测度。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"38a37d8a0a52c221","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"38a37d8a0a52c221","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)\\in\\mathcal P_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction]]，$n=L(\\Pi)$。$a,b\\in\\mathcal M$，其中 $\\mathcal M$ 由下式引入；下式引入元组论域 $\\mathcal M$、严格序 $\\triangleleft_{SR}$ 及非严格序 $\\unlhd_{SR}$。元组分量下标从0开始。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)\\in\\mathcal P_R","display":false},{"tex":"n=L(\\Pi)","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\triangleleft_{SR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd_{SR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\{a\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}:a_0=n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_{SR}(\\Pi)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}(0)&n=0,\\\\(n,|U_{n-1}|,\\ldots,|U_0|)&n>0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mu_{SR}(\\Pi)\\in\\mathcal M.","display":true},{"tex":"a\\triangleleft_{SR}b\\iff a_0<b_0\\lor\\bigl(a_0=b_0\\land\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(1\\le k\\le\\min(a_0,b_0)\\land a_k<b_k\\land\\forall j<k\\;(a_j=b_j))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"a\\unlhd_{SR}b\\iff a=b\\lor a\\triangleleft_{SR}b.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_{SR}(\\mathbf1^P_s)=(0).","display":true}],"bytes":1784,"backlinks":[{"id":"c5480512d7aeecf6","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)\\in\\mathcal P_R$，$n=L(\\Pi)$；路径、区间及串行化见 [[56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction]]，$\\operatorname{wit}_R$ 见 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。$P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(T(\\Pi))$；$\\operatorname{RPat}_R,\\operatorname{Anc}_R$ 见 [[56-df-trace-ancestors]]，$\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,-)$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]。测度论域 $\\mathcal M$ 与序见 [[56-df-sr-measure]]。$\\operatorname{NAct}_R(\\Pi,P,i)$ 的指标定义域为 $0\\le i<n$；正贡献槽的指标集及有序计数序列在 Assertion 中形式定义。"},{"id":"30c9caa6f210ffe7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal M,\\triangleleft_{SR},\\unlhd_{SR}$ 采用 [[56-df-sr-measure]]。$\\omega=\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-sr-measure.md]]"},{"id":"efe12b141b93e7e9","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{Std}_R,\\operatorname{PStd}_R$ 见 [[56-df-standard-labelled-reduction]]；$\\operatorname{wit}_R,\\approx_R$ 分别取 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]、[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]] 的具体归约见证与置换等价。有限证明项的归约化见 [[56-lem-proofterm-serialization]]，SR测度及其良基性见 [[56-df-sr-measure]]、[[56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded]]；标准路径的单元素平行化保持标准性见 [[56-lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard]]。"}],"outgoing":["38a37d8a0a52c221"]}